From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:15:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(drawer): wait for the current native scroll binding
 before snapping

DrawerInternalPagerState.animateScrollToPage wrote the snap offset through
kuiklyInfo.scrollView, which can be null or a stale view while the drawer
scroller is rebound. Add ScrollViewBindingGate to KuiklyScrollInfo, clear
the binding when SubcomposeLayout disposes the bound view, and run the snap
only against the view that is current at that moment.

Fork-Patch: compose-drawer-scrollview-binding-gate
Origin: 0e101b7a
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
